        "@": {
          "comment": "1px, not 2. southleft.com draws every rule as a hairline — the header underline, the section rules, the card outlines, the footer's top border are all 1px there. The brand shipped 2px, which doubled every one of them; at 1440 the header underline measured 2px against the reference's 1px. `md` stays 4px for the deliberately heavy accents.",
